\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Oppressed with sin and woe,
\par A burdened heart I bear;
\par Opposed by many a mighty foe,
\par Yet will I not despair.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. With this polluted heart,
\par I dare to come to Thee-
\par Holy and mighty as Thou  art-
\par For Thou wilt pardon me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I feel that I am weak,
\par And prone to every sin;
\par But Thou who giv'st to those who seek,
\par Wilt give me strength within.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I need not fear my foes;
\par I need not yield to care;
\par I need not sink beneath my woes,
\par For Thou wilt answer prayer.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Im my Redeemer's name,
\par I give myself to Thee;
\par And, all unworthy as I am,
\par My God will welcome me.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

